NeoVerse reconstruction inference adapter
-----------------------------------------
The reconstruction assembly in worldfoundry/synthesis/visual_generation/neoverse/native/worldmirror.py
is adapted from the NeoVerse inference-only WorldMirror path, reusing existing WorldFoundry Mirror
modules and the NeoVerse Gaussian renderer. Upstream: https://github.com/IamCreateAI/NeoVerse
(reference bb97880d3f6d5cb06b2fcccc8ca889e0988daa4d), Apache License 2.0.
Modifications: reuse shared legacy Mirror building blocks; omit disabled motion branches explicitly;
strictly load active roles and preserve per-frame Gaussian timestamps. The Apache License 2.0 text
is reproduced above. Checkpoint weights remain subject to their upstream terms.

MoVerse streaming compatibility
-------------------------------

  Source: https://github.com/Orange-3DV-Team/MoVerse
  Source revision: ae146303a826dfa7af2fea81fc492c9bc39651e8

  The MoVerse-specific WanLayerNorm preserves the activation dtype used by
  the upstream ``wan/modules/model.py``. It extends the existing shared Wan
  layer without changing normalization for other Wan model families.
  The streaming text-attention adapter also retains the upstream context KV
  cache behavior while reusing the shared Wan projections and attention kernel.
  The referenced Wan source credits Copyright 2024-2025 The Alibaba Wan Team
  Authors. All rights reserved. Checkpoint terms remain separate.


